.TH GOD 1
.SH NAME
god \- entropy word and song toy
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/god
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I God
is a entropy word and song toy.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Entropy from the clock and keyboard feeds buttons that pick a vocabulary word, play a generated song, or show a passage from Dante's
.I Inferno
(Longfellow translation).
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B Add entropy button
Insert timer entropy into bit fifo
.TP
.B God Word button
Pick word from vocab via GodBits
.TP
.B God Song button
Generate and play song (fixed Normal/octave 4)
.TP
.B Inferno passage button
Pick passage from Inferno.TXT
.TP
.B keyboard (any)
Also feeds entropy
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH FILES
.TP
.B /lib/temple/vocab.txt
Data file.
.TP
.B /lib/temple/Inferno.TXT
Dante's Inferno (Project Gutenberg / Longfellow).
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/god.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR tone (2),
.IR wm (1)
